"In order: check the sending address was spelled exactly, look in Spam and Trash under “Others”, then check that the sender is not on the suppression list because they unsubscribed earlier. If the mailbox is connected and the message is still missing, the mail server has to be involved. That is a support matter." = "请依次：检查发件地址是否拼写正确，在“其他”下查看垃圾邮件和已删除，然后检查发件人是否因之前退订而在屏蔽名单中。如果邮箱已连接但邮件仍未出现，就需要邮件服务器介入，这属于客服处理范围。";
